{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n# Outliers, leverage and influence diagnostics\nRead the observation from three perspectives: outcome departure, predictor position and change in a specified fitted result. Then choose the diagnostic scale and deletion unit. A flag prompts investigation of the record, target and model; it does not choose an exclusion.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n# 异常值、杠杆与影响诊断\n从结果偏离、解释变量位置与指定拟合结果的变化三个角度理解观测，再选择诊断尺度和删除单位。标记引导核查记录、目标与模型，本身不决定排除。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 3580,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000002",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[多重共线性.canvas|From columns to observations]]\nCollinearity concerns overlapping information among design columns. This map asks about individual rows and groups of rows. Column dependence and high leverage are distinct questions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[多重共线性.canvas|从列转向观测]]\n共线性检查设计列之间的信息重叠；这里检查单行及成组观测。列依赖与高杠杆是不同问题。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000003",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[满列秩投影公式|Projection geometry]]\nFor a full-column-rank design, the orthogonal projector maps outcomes into fitted values. Its diagonal gives own-response sensitivity; the geometry does not decide whether a record belongs in the study.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[满列秩投影公式|投影几何]]\n满列秩设计的正交投影把结果变成拟合值，对角元给出自身结果的敏感度；几何性质不决定记录是否应纳入研究。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[残差图边界|Interpreting residual plots]]\nA vertical gap is a clue about outcome departure. Its scale depends on fitting and leverage; the gap alone does not measure how much a chosen coefficient or prediction changes after deletion.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[残差图边界]]\n竖直缺口提示结果偏离，其尺度受拟合与杠杆影响；缺口大小本身不衡量删点后指定系数或预测的变化。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000005",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[残差协方差诊断|Residual scale and dependence]]\nFitting changes residual variances and correlations. Studentizing supports scale comparisons under stated assumptions; it does not repair a wrong mean or eliminate dependence.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[残差协方差诊断]]\n拟合改变残差方差与相关性。学生化在相应假设下便于尺度比较，不修复错误均值，也不消除依赖。",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000006",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[观测行协方差|Dependent records]]\nRepeated people, firms or schools may share shocks. Row deletion and group deletion ask different questions. Match the unit to the design, dependence and target; dependence alone does not choose it.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[观测行协方差|有依赖的记录]]\n重复观察的人、公司或学校可能共享冲击。删行与删组问不同问题；单位须匹配设计、依赖与目标，不能只凭依赖层级决定。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000007",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[设定修复循环|Recheck a justified revision]]\nRecord the target, data correction or model change, then diagnose again. An interpretable comparison helps attribute changes. Simultaneously altering several ingredients does not by itself separate their effects.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[设定修复循环]]\n记录目标、数据更正或模型修改，再重新诊断。可解释的比较便于追踪变化；同时调整多个要素的一次比较，本身不能分离各自效果。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 1440,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000008",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[异常杠杆影响区分|Three different questions]]\nAn outlier concerns outcome departure, leverage concerns predictor position, and influence concerns a specified result after refitting. A high-leverage point can leave the coefficients unchanged.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[异常杠杆影响区分]]\n异常值关心结果偏离，杠杆关心解释变量位置，影响关心重拟合后的指定结果。高杠杆点也可能完全不改变系数。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000009",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Hat杠杆值|Hat values and leverage]]\nWith a fixed unweighted OLS design, changing only outcome i by one changes its own fit by hᵢᵢ. The value depends on the design. Actual deletion changes the design too and asks another question.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[Hat杠杆值]]\n固定不加权 OLS 设计，只把结果 i 增加一，其自身拟合值便增加 hᵢᵢ。该值由设计决定；真正删点还会改变设计，属于另一种比较。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b9100000000000a",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[学生化残差|Studentized residuals]]\nInternal scaling uses the full-fit error estimate; external scaling estimates it without the case. A deleted prediction error is another quantity. Rank, degrees of freedom and positive scales matter; an exact t law needs Gaussian model conditions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[学生化残差]]\n内部尺度用全样本误差估计，外部尺度排除该点再估计；删除预测误差是另一种量。须满足秩、自由度及正尺度条件，精确 t 律还需 Gaussian 模型条件。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b9100000000000b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[删点影响定义|Delete-one influence]]\nRefit and compare the same named target: coefficients, predictions at fixed positions or estimated uncertainty. One target can change while another stays fixed. An undefined reduced fit is not zero influence.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[删点影响定义]]\n重拟合后比较同一个明确目标：系数、固定位置的预测或估计不确定性。一项目标可能改变，另一项保持不变；删点拟合无法定义，不等于零影响。",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b9100000000000c",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[删点单位边界|Choose the deletion unit]]\nTwo cases can mask their joint effect when removed one at a time. Choose a row or meaningful group to answer the stated question. Check estimability and convergence; single-case OLS formulas do not define every group diagnostic.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[删点单位边界]]\n两个点逐一删除时，可能掩蔽联合效果。按明确问题选择单行或有意义的组，并检查可估性与收敛；单点 OLS 公式不定义所有删组诊断。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 620,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b9100000000000d",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Cook距离|Cook’s distance]]\nCombine squared fitted-value changes at all original design points, dividing by the coefficient count times the full-fit residual variance estimate. This nonnegative global summary does not identify which coefficient moved.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[Cook距离]]\n汇总所有原设计位置的拟合值平方变化，除以系数个数乘全样本残差方差估计。这个非负全局摘要不指出究竟哪个系数移动。",
      "x": 1040,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b9100000000000e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[DFFITS]]\nMeasure the signed fitted-value change at the omitted case’s original predictor position. Scale it with the deleted residual estimate and full-design leverage. This scale is generally not the standard error of that difference.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[DFFITS]]\n衡量被删点原解释变量位置的有符号拟合变化，以删点残差估计和全设计杠杆缩放。该尺度一般不等于这个差值的标准误。",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b9100000000000f",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[DFBETAS]]\nScale each coefficient’s full-minus-deleted change using deleted residual variability and full-design coefficient geometry. Keep the parameterization fixed. Software names alone do not distinguish raw from standardized changes.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[DFBETAS]]\n逐系数比较“全样本减删点”的变化，结合删点残差波动和全设计系数几何缩放。保持参数化一致；软件名称本身不能区分原单位与标准化变化。",
      "x": 2080,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[影响诊断阈值|Screening thresholds]]\nReference lines prioritize investigation; conventions differ with statistic, sample size and parameter count. Check the full pattern and valid definitions. A crossing is neither proof of an error nor a calibrated test by itself.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[影响诊断阈值]]\n参考线安排核查顺序，不同统计量、样本量与参数计数有不同约定。查看整组模式并确认定义有效；越线本身既不证明错误，也不是已经校准的检验。",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "5b91000000000011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[异常观测处理原则|Handle the evidence]]\nCheck the original record, target population and model. Correct verified errors; justify exclusions independently of a preferred result. For valid unusual observations, compare substantive targets and report sensitivity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n## [[异常观测处理原则]]\n核查原记录、目标总体与模型；更正确认的错误，排除理由须独立于想要的结果。面对有效特殊观测，比较实质目标并报告敏感性。",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": 1060,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "5"
    }
  ],
